# Bugzilla API Key
#
# Generate your API key in Bugzilla:
#   1. Log into https://bugzilla.suse.com (or https://bugzilla.opensuse.org)
#   2. Go to Preferences -> API Keys
#   3. Create an API key
#   4. Save your key into secrets/bugzilla-token.txt
#
# Note: Lines starting with '#' are ignored by run.sh.
# Replace the placeholder below with your real API key:
YOUR_BUGZILLA_API_KEY_HERE
